  {"comment": "A design for tools/ui-scripts/drawing-blank-sheet.mitcad-ui (mitcad#2325): a 40 x 30 x 20 block and Drawing1 (D1, A3, the ISO template: its frame and its title block) with one sheet and a base view, the sheet's title Kept."},
